Package: wickrasynth
Type: Package
Title: Deterministic Synthetic Market Microstructure
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("kingchenc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@wickra.org")
Description: R bindings for wickra-synth over its C ABI hub: a seeded GenSpec
    generates byte-identical OHLCV candles, order-book snapshots, trades and
    funding - the same protocol as the CLI and every other binding.
License: MIT + file LICENSE | Apache License 2.0
URL: https://github.com/wickra-lib/wickra-synth
BugReports: https://github.com/wickra-lib/wickra-synth/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: none. configure downloads the prebuilt wickra-synth C
    ABI matching this package's version and bundles it; set WKSYNTH_INC and
    WKSYNTH_LIB to build against a local one instead.
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
